{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00852","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 艾如张 · 李贺","name":"鼓吹曲辞 艾如张","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦襜褕，绣裆襦，强强饮啄哺尔雏。\n陇东卧穟满风雨，莫信龙媒陇西去。\n齐人织网如素空，张在野春平碧中。\n网丝漠漠无形影，误尔触之伤首红。\n艾叶绿花谁翦刻，中藏祸机不可测。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}